WEBVTT

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.750
I will not yield. Not to this flood.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:13.250
The flood may wash away the ink,
but it cannot stop my spirit.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.550
I will fight to the last drop.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.650
Hello down there!
Can you hear me across the sea?

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:31.350
This new world is filled with secrets.
Let us explore it together.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.850
To the distance, we must advance.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.350
The Palette Island awaits us.
I will lead the way.

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.100
Look at how the golden lines guide us.
It's beautiful.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.350
This must be the map to the sunlit portal.

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:51.300
This dark water means our certain end.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:55.100
I cannot swim across this stream.
We must find another path.

00:00:56.500 --> 00:01:00.100
Let's see if this one will float.
A perfect fit for the journey ahead.

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.250
I will find the way.
Just you wait and see.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:21.600
We must find where this ancient map leads.

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:27.100
Before the golden light fades away completely,
the skiff is almost there, just a little further.

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:58.150
We made it.
The horizon is finally ours.

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:06.400
Look at this place. It's incredible.
The symbol is real.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.900
Never open the lower drawer.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:13.700
The first draft remains unfinished.
